                        "entry_id": "11e8109d-34c7-349c-b24a-5fd43099523f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Opposed to the existing sociopolitical system (the establishment)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "db990823-1303-4071-a197-9ab9a190dee3",
                                "sense_id": "954f75bf-4d73-300f-bc4e-2284c8927067",
                                "text": "The hippies were noted for their anti-establishment ways, firmly opposed to the order their parents so revered."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "571bbde7-ff22-4230-8847-82e77d44d20b",
                                "sense_id": "954f75bf-4d73-300f-bc4e-2284c8927067",
                                "text": "Almost one-third of Europeans now vote for populist, far-right or far-left parties, research shows, with wide support for anti-establishment politics surging across the continent in an increasingly problematic challenge to the mainstream."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
